{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50898","headline":"昭阳落花 · 王贞白","name":"昭阳落花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空树落花时，宫嫔泣暮晖。\n尽皆承雨露，争不惜芳菲。\n残蘂犹黏草，余香尚惹衣。\n无言属青鸟，青鸟自衔飞。\n（以上见《永乐大典》卷五八三九「十六麻」「花」字「落花」条〖七函六十一册〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}